{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"files\":[{\"content\":\"#include<stdio.h>\\n#include<stdlib.h>\\n#include<math.h>\\n\\nstatic int use_parallel_columns(int lin, int col) {\\n    size_t rows, columns, target;\\n\\n    if (lin <= 0 || col < 4) {\\n        return 0;\\n    }\\n\\n    rows = (size_t)lin;\\n    columns = (size_t)col;\\n    target = (size_t)262144 / columns;\\n    if ((size_t)262144 % columns != 0) {\\n        target++;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Equivalent to rows * rows * columns >= 262144 without overflow. */\\n    return rows >= target / rows + (target % rows != 0);\\n}\\n\\nvoid bubble_sort(double *matriz, int tam) {\\n    int i, j;\\n    double aux;\\n\\n    for (i = tam - 1; i > 0; i--) {\\n        for (j = 0; j < i; j++) {\\n            if (matriz[j] > matriz[j + 1]) {\\n                aux = matriz[j];\\n                matriz[j] = matriz[j + 1];\\n                matriz[j + 1] = aux;\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nstatic double moda_aux_com_nan(double *matriz, int lin) {\\n    int i, j;\\n    int melhor_contagem = 0;\\n    double moda = -1;\\n\\n    for (i = 0; i < lin; i++) {\\n        int conta = 0;\\n        for (j = i + 1; j < lin; j++) {\\n            if (matriz[i] == matriz[j]) {\\n                conta++;\\n            }\\n        }\\n        if (conta > melhor_contagem) {\\n            melhor_contagem = conta;\\n            moda = matriz[i];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    return moda;\\n}\\n\\nstatic double moda_aux(double *matriz, int lin) {\\n    int i = 0;\\n    int maior_contagem = 1;\\n    double moda = -1;\\n\\n    while (i < lin) {\\n        int fim;\\n        if (matriz[i] != matriz[i]) {\\n            return moda_aux_com_nan(matriz, lin);\\n        }\\n        fim = i + 1;\\n        while (fim < lin) {\\n            if (matriz[fim] != matriz[fim]) {\\n                return moda_aux_com_nan(matriz, lin);\\n            }\\n            if (matriz[fim] != matriz[i]) {\\n                break;\\n            }\\n            fim++;\\n        }\\n        if (fim - i > maior_contagem) {\\n            maior_contagem = fim - i;\\n            moda = matriz[i];\\n        }\\n        i = fim;\\n    }\\n    return moda;\\n}\\n\\nstatic void calcula_colunas(double *matriz, double *mediana, double *media,\\n                            double *media_har, double *moda,\\n                            double *variancia, double *dp, double *cv,\\n                            int lin, int col) {\\n    int i, j;\\n\\n    #pragma omp for schedule(static)\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++) {\\n        double soma, soma_inversos, valor;\\n        int indice;\\n\\n        soma = 0;\\n        soma_inversos = 0;\\n        for (j = 0; j < lin; j++) {\\n            valor = matriz[i * lin + j];\\n            soma += valor;\\n            soma_inversos += 1 / valor;\\n        }\\n        media[i] = soma / lin;\\n        media_har[i] = lin / soma_inversos;\\n\\n        bubble_sort(&matriz[i * lin], lin);\\n\\n        indice = ((i * lin) + (i + 1) * lin - 1) / 2;\\n        if ((lin - 1) % 2) {\\n            mediana[i] = matriz[indice] + matriz[indice + 1];\\n            mediana[i] *= 0.5;\\n        } else {\\n            mediana[i] = matriz[indice];\\n        }\\n\\n        moda[i] = moda_aux(matriz + (i * lin), lin);\\n\\n        soma = 0;\\n        for (j = 0; j < lin; j++) {\\n            soma += pow((matriz[i * lin + j] - media[i]), 2);\\n        }\\n        variancia[i] = soma / (lin - 1);\\n        dp[i] = sqrt(variancia[i]);\\n        cv[i] = dp[i] / media[i];\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nint main(int argc, char **argv) {\\n    int lin, col, i, j, parallel_columns;\\n    double *matriz, *mediana, *media, *media_har, *moda;\\n    double *variancia, *dp, *cv;\\n\\n    fscanf(stdin, \\\"%d \\\", &lin);\\n    fscanf(stdin, \\\"%d\\\\n\\\", &col);\\n    parallel_columns = use_parallel_columns(lin, col);\\n\\n    matriz = (double *)malloc(lin * col * sizeof(double));\\n    media = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    media_har = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    mediana = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    moda = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    variancia = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    cv = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n    dp = (double *)malloc(col * sizeof(double));\\n\\n    for (i = 0; i < lin; i++) {\\n        for (j = 0; j < col; j++) {\\n            fscanf(stdin, \\\"%lf \\\", &(matriz[j * lin + i]));\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    #pragma omp parallel num_threads(4) if(parallel_columns)\\n    {\\n        calcula_colunas(matriz, mediana, media, media_har, moda,\\n                        variancia, dp, cv, lin, col);\\n    }\\n\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", media[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", media_har[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", mediana[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", moda[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", variancia[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", dp[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n    for (i = 0; i < col; i++)\\n        printf(\\\"%.1lf \\\", cv[i]);\\n    printf(\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\n\\n    free(matriz);\\n    free(media);\\n    free(media_har);\\n    free(mediana);\\n    free(moda);\\n    free(variancia);\\n    free(dp);\\n    free(cv);\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"src/est_matriz_seq.c\"}],\"hypothesis\":\"A single static per-column worksharing loop can reduce synchronization overhead across the statistics pipeline, while fusing the arithmetic and harmonic mean traversals avoids a second input pass without changing either accumulation order. Combining these with bounded four-thread execution and the linear mode scan may improve full-program time; the controller should measure the combined effect.\",\"notes\":\"Full-program candidate only; no commands or local measurements were run. The mode scan uses a pairwise fallback when NaNs are present and preserves first-longest-run ties for sorted finite columns.\",\"sources_kept\":[\"333faec38f7e45ca\",\"58d5284b7cb146c6\",\"462501e96d8343ab\"],\"transformations\":[\"Combined per-column statistics into one static OpenMP worksharing loop inside a four-thread region, using an overflow-safe generic threshold based on the existing quadratic bubble-sort work.\",\"Fused arithmetic-mean and harmonic-mean passes into one per-column traversal while maintaining each metric's accumulation order.\",\"Replaced the allocated quadratic mode scan with a linear run scan over sorted columns, retaining the first longest run and returning -1 when unique; use pairwise comparison for NaN-containing columns.\"]}"}}
